# Local-only docs, notes, and project planning files
#
# docs/ policy: only pump.txt and dump.txt are committed going forward.
# Anything else in docs/ (vendor PDFs from FCB Container Team, screenshots,
# ROSA-related notes, ad-hoc Markdown) stays local. Files already tracked
# at the time this rule was added stay tracked — gitignore only suppresses
# NEW untracked files, so historical PDFs and the capacity PNG keep their
# git history. To add a new file under docs/ deliberately, use
# `git add -f path/to/file`.
docs/*
!docs/pump.txt
!docs/dump.txt
notes.md
*.xlsx
generate_*gantt*.py

# Temporary
tmp/
note.txt
